---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE, CONTACT, BUSINESS } from '../lib/config';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — SK Immigration Services"
  description="Privacy Policy for SK Immigration Services (SMC-Private) Limited, CUIN 0304985. How we collect, use, and protect your personal data."
  canonical="/privacy/"
>
  <section class="not-prose">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-12 text-center sm:px-6 md:py-16">
      <p class="text-base font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-primary">Legal</p>
      <h1 class="font-heading mt-2 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-5xl dark:text-white">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted">Last updated: August 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section-container">
    <div class="prose prose-slate mx-auto max-w-3xl dark:prose-invert">
      <div class="mb-8 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-5 not-prose dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800">
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
          This Privacy Policy applies to <strong>{SITE.legalName}</strong> (CUIN {BUSINESS.cuin}),
          operating <strong>{SITE.url}</strong>. By using our website or services, you agree to this policy.
        </p>
      </div>
      <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>We collect information you provide directly, including:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Name, phone number, and email submitted via our contact form or WhatsApp</li>
        <li>Immigration-related information you share during consultations</li>
        <li>Technical data collected via Google Analytics (GA4)</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To respond to consultation enquiries</li>
        <li>To prepare your immigration file if you engage our services</li>
        <li>To send service-related communications you requested</li>
        <li>To improve the website (analytics)</li>
        <li>To comply with applicable laws in Pakistan</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>3. Google Analytics &amp; Advertising</h2>
      <p>
        We use Google Analytics 4 with anonymised IP addresses and Google AdSense. For visitors in the EEA, UK, and Switzerland,
        analytics and advertising cookies are <strong>denied by default</strong> until consent is given (Google Consent Mode v2).
        Opt out of Google Analytics at
        <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout</a>.
      </p>
      <h2>4. Data Sharing</h2>
      <p>We do <strong>not</strong> sell your personal data. We may share information only:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>With embassies, VFS Global, or government authorities to process your file (with your consent)</li>
        <li>With Google (Analytics and AdSense) under their privacy policies</li>
        <li>If required by Pakistani law or court order</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>5. Data Retention</h2>
      <p>Client file data is retained for up to 5 years after service completion. Website analytics data is retained for 26 months (GA4 default).</p>
      <h2>6. Your Rights</h2>
      <p>
        Request access, correction, or deletion at
        <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT.email}`}>{CONTACT.email}</a>
        or WhatsApp <a href={`tel:${CONTACT.phone}`}>{CONTACT.phoneFormatted}</a>.
      </p>
      <h2>7. Security</h2>
      <p>The website is served over HTTPS. WhatsApp communications are end-to-end encrypted.</p>
      <h2>8. External Links</h2>
      <p>Guides link to official embassy websites. We are not responsible for their privacy practices.</p>
      <h2>9. Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>Material changes will be noted with a new “Last updated” date at the top of this page.</p>
      <h2>10. Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Privacy enquiries: <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT.email}`}>{CONTACT.email}</a><br />
        Office: {CONTACT.address.full}
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
